{"text": "1972\n\n02/21/78\n04/27/78\n05/02/78\n05/08/78\n\n12/29/78\n\n02/11/80\n\n01/23/81\n01/23/81\n01/23/81\n\n01/23/81\n\n04/27/82\n\n05/15/82\n\n05/15/82\n\n05/31/82\n\n12\n\n10\n\n11\n\n11\n\n11\n\nAlan Gottieb arrived in Seattle, WA from New York and\ntook over, then an ad hoc committee called National\nStudents Committee for the Right to Keep and Bear Arms.\n\u201cDeed of Trust for property at 1119 Bellefiels Park Lane,\nBellevue, WA. Payment of $53,200. filed 02/27/78.\nPurchase by Alan Gottlieb of condominium at 1119\nBellefield Park Lane, Bellevue, WA for $53,200. Intended\nfor residential use only.\nAcceptance of Deed of Trust. signed by Gottlieb\nDeed of Trust between Gottlieb and Safeco Title Insurance\nCo. and City Development Co. Payment of $63,650.\nArticles of Incorporationifiled at request of Merril\nAssociates, 1601 114th SE, Suite 155, Bellevue. WA.\nUndersigned by Alan M. Gottlieb. Directors of business\nlisted as: Alan M. Gottlieb of 1119 Bellefield Pk. Ln.; Julie\nH. Versnel of 119 Bellefield Pk. Ln.; Michael Gottlieb of\n13750 NE 12th, #203. All located in Bellevue.\nKabco Inc., through its President, George Kezner, created\n. Cougar Hills Estates. Gottlieb et al\u2019are were residents of\nCougar Hills Estates condominiums. George and Betty\nKezner maintained sole control of Cougar Hills Estates\nAssn and acted as officer and directors from its creation\nuntil 05/20/82.\nVFull Reconveyances Grantor\u2018as Alan and Julianne\nGottliebY Beneficiary;as Lincoln Mutual Savings Bank.\nTruste\u00e9; as Columbia Savings Bank. filed 01/27/81.\n\u201cBorrower's not\u00e9idated. Principal sum of $101,400.\nDeed of Trust signed by Alan and Julianne Versnel\nGottlieb for purchase of 4231 155th Place SE, Bellevue.\nStatutory Warranty De\u00e9d. Grantor as Kabco, Inc. Trustee as\nPioneer National Title Insurance Co. Beneficiary as\nLincoln Mutual Savings Bank. filed 01/27/81.\nOriginal date ofVAssigment of Rents and Leases for\n$363,000\nAssigment of Rents and Leases. Lessor\u2018as Alan & Julie\nGottlieb. Lessee as SAF & CCRKBA. Payment of $363,000.\nOriginally dated 04/27/82.\nDeed of Trust. Assignment of Rents and Security\nAgreement made by Alan & Julie H. Gottlieb; Trustor as\nSAF. Principal amount is $363,000 which is due by\n07/1/87. Promisary nof\u00e9 executed by Alan M. Gottlieb &\nJulie H. Gottlieb. Signed by Alan Gottlieb for Himself,\nSAF, and CCRKBA. Signed by Julie H. Gottlieb.\nDelinquent assessments as of this date. accrued beginning\n06/01/80.",
